    "long_instructions": "## Brainstorm With AI\r\n\r\nReliability Engineers use AI to parse tickets, analyze failure \r\npatterns, and ideate on recovery solutions. Now it's your turn.\r\n\r\nChoose a ticket from Level 1 and use the AI chat to brainstorm \r\nyour recovery state design. Add your ticket as context using \r\nfiles in the Library.\r\n\r\n**Try asking things like:**\r\n- \"Help me write a friendly error message for this ticket.\"\r\n- \"Is this error message too technical? How can I simplify it?\"\r\n- \"What should a Retry button say for a concert ticketing app?\"\r\n- \"What tone should I use when telling a user their data didn't load?\"\r\n",
